      "message": "[warning] Line 2152: 🟡 When `conv.info.invited` has no entry, this resend path generates a fresh timestamp but does not store it. Repeated `NeedConversationRequest` messages for older conversations will therefore keep producing new invite timestamps and can be interpreted as fresh re-invitations each time. When falling back to `nowMs()`, persist that value in `conv.info.invited[from]` before sending so subsequent passive resends remain stable.",
      "revId": "00423720e2ea1662d4c6c46e39bacaae83e56a0a",
